Error [E0060]: C FFI modules use `#Extern`, not `@extern`
  --> tests/ui/cffi_retired_at_extern.jet:1:1
    |
  1 | @extern module c.demo {
    | ^^^^^^^
 Why: C FFI markers are PascalCase `#` markers so generated and hand-written bindings share one marker family
 Fix: write `#Extern` before `module c.<lib>`
